m%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"LSDqz\" id=\"LSDqz\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6626663e\" id=\"u6626663e\">返回值注意点</span></h2><ul list=\"u84fed485\"><li fid=\"u66242e5b\" data-lake-id=\"u525ad5e5\" id=\"u525ad5e5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u93e9eeaf\" id=\"u93e9eeaf\">return的作用是结束函数</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u84fed485\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u66242e5b\" data-lake-id=\"u4bdc0d93\" id=\"u4bdc0d93\"><span data-lake-id=\"ued5d03b9\" id=\"ued5d03b9\">函数内，return后面的代码不会执行</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u84fed485\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u66242e5b\" data-lake-id=\"u476facd1\" id=\"u476facd1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u409e624b\" id=\"u409e624b\">示例代码</span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%5Cnvoid%20func()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%2211111111111111111%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E7%BB%93%E6%9D%9F%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%EF%BC%8C%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%86%85%E5%90%8E%E9%9D%A2%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22222222222222222222%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%5Cn%20%20%20%20func()%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22__widthMode%22%3A%22normal%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GMyDB%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%2C%22widthMode%22%3A%22normal%22%7D\" hindent=\"2em\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"r7dZN\" id=\"r7dZN\"><span data-lake-id=\"u23030a2b\" id=\"u23030a2b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">函数的声明</span></h1><ul list=\"u8fb34cef\"><li fid=\"u217e26d2\" data-lake-id=\"u263cf0fc\" id=\"u263cf0fc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4e08075f\" id=\"u4e08075f\">如果函数定义代码没有放在函数调用的前面，这时候需要先做函数的声明</span></li><li fid=\"u217e26d2\" data-lake-id=\"ucda4201a\" id=\"ucda4201a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud6f24a0f\" id=\"ud6f24a0f\">所谓函数声明，相当于告诉编译器，函数是有定义的，在别的地方定义，以便使编译能正常进行</span></li><li fid=\"u217e26d2\" data-lake-id=\"u2f340c39\" id=\"u2f340c39\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4cd45dd1\" id=\"u4cd45dd1\">注意：一个函数只能被</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub7e424e5\" id=\"ub7e424e5\">定义</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u82a288c4\" id=\"u82a288c4\">一次，但可以</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8542abef\" id=\"u8542abef\">声明</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4ae96680\" id=\"u4ae96680\">多次</span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%86%E5%8F%B7%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%9C%81%E7%95%A5%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E7%9A%84%E5%89%8D%E9%9D%A2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%8A%A0extern%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A0%5Cn%2F%2F%20extern%20int%20my_add(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%3B%5Cnint%20my_add(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%3B%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%A2%E5%8F%82%E5%90%8D%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%99%5Cn%2F%2F%20int%20my_add(int%2C%20int%20)%3B%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20temp%20%3D%20my_add(10%2C%2020)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22temp%20%20%3D%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20temp)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%5Cnint%20my_add(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B02%E4%B8%AA%E5%BD%A2%E5%8F%82%E7%9B%B8%E5%8A%A0%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%E7%B4%AF%E5%8A%A0%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20res%20%3D%20a%20%2B%20b%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20res%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gLk9Q%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u8e5926a5\" id=\"u8e5926a5\"><br></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"VwuVS\" id=\"VwuVS\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7ce6154f\" id=\"u7ce6154f\">函数案例</span></h1><ul list=\"u8cd4d172\"><li fid=\"ue34f05eb\" data-lake-id=\"u1f68728b\" id=\"u1f68728b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u33274f6f\" id=\"u33274f6f\">需求：自定义一个函数</span><code data-lake-id=\"uc366d265\" id=\"uc366d265\"><span data-lake-id=\"u48df7ba6\" id=\"u48df7ba6\">my_max</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1e0c5023\" id=\"u1e0c5023\">，返回2个整数的最大值</span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%5Cnint%20my_max(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20(a%20%3E%20b)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20a%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%20else%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20b%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20res%20%3D%20my_max(100%2C%20200)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22res%20%3D%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20res)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Atrue%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22__widthMode%22%3A%22normal%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OHJYK%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%2C%22widthMode%22%3A%22normal%22%7D\" hindent=\"2em\"></card>",
